也不排除适用法律规定的合理使用、合理处理等例外与限制。
是否适用这些例外取决于具体情况，不能仅凭引用长短作出保证。

Reading the book and applying what you learn to your own work is not, by
itself, reproduction or commercial exploitation of the book's expression.
Copying, distributing or adapting its text, images or code remains subject
to the applicable license and law. The license does not restrict ideas,
